{"product_id":"flying-scotsman-the-graeme-obree-story","title":"Flying Scotsman: The Graeme Obree Story","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe story of a cyclist who took on the world and rewrote the record books. Graeme's story starts with his tough upbringing in Ayrshire, where he found his escape by taking to the roads. He tells the story of how he became a world record breaker, and of his battle with depression.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 156 x 234\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Graeme Obree\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781841583358\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45195442389145,"sku":"7RC9781841583358","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67c87f6465ccd_Flying_20Scotsman-_20The_20Graeme_20Obree_20Story_20Graeme_20Obree.jpg?v=1741283962","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/flying-scotsman-the-graeme-obree-story","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}